```

don't appear to have explicit hard thresholds in the shown gate.

More fundamentally:

**the proof shouldn't itself decide policy.**

Separate:

```text
TranslationProof
```

from:

```text
PublicationPolicy
```

Because different surfaces may have different requirements.

For example:

```text
