public machine translation:
requires negation PASS + source coverage...

scholar edition:
requires independent reviewer

canonical edition:
requires adjudication
```

So:

```text
proof = facts
policy = requirements
gate = evaluate(proof, policy)
```

That makes the system vastly more reusable.

