```text
what changed
what depends on it
how to rebuild it
what hash is expected
```

A small custom incremental compiler is therefore likely more valuable than importing a gigantic generic workflow scheduler.

Use Cloudflare Queues or a simple durable work queue for distribution where necessary.

But the **dependency semantics live in Pāṭala**, not in Airflow.

This matches `SPEC-00`, which explicitly says you may not need Dagster/Airflow for the projection DAG.

