# 8. Humans become extremely fast because most of the site isn't an application

This is where Astro makes sense.

A page such as:

```text
/texts/ipvv
/passages/ipvv-1.5.11
/people/abhinavagupta
/concepts/pratyabhijna
/arguments/ARG019
```

should usually already exist as:

```text
