→ JS
→ API
→ Worker
→ DB
→ graph query
→ JSON
→ React
→ render
```

Instead:

```text
browser
    ↓
nearest Cloudflare edge
    ↓
already generated HTML
```

Cloudflare currently supports asset-first routing: if the file exists as a static asset, it is served without invoking Worker code. ([Cloudflare Docs][1])

So a normal reading route becomes close to CDN performance.

### JavaScript only where interaction genuinely exists

```text
GraphExplorer
ArgumentMap
Search
Compare
Timeline
